<h2 id="out-of-scope" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">16. Out of scope</h2>

- Do not turn every chat turn into a story.
- Do not duplicate **full** chat logs inside **`war_stories/WAR_STORIES.md`**; **distill** and link to commits, PRs, or paths instead.
- Do not treat **ephemeral** drafting paths (for example scratch directories or **untracked** research notes) as the **sole** home for a captured decision—mirror the durable parts into **`§N.4`** (see [Writing quality §12](#writing-quality-rules)).
